# =============================================================================
# HUONG DAN TAO FILE .env
# =============================================================================
# 1. Copy file nay thanh .env o thu muc goc project (cung cho voi pom.xml):
#      Windows (PowerShell):  Copy-Item .env.example .env
#      macOS / Linux / Git Bash:  cp .env.example .env
# 2. Dien gia tri that vao .env theo tung muc ben duoi.
# 3. Khoi dong lai ung dung (Stop roi Run). .env chi duoc doc luc app khoi dong,
#    devtools tu reload KHONG doc lai file nay.
#
# Quy tac viet file:
#   - Moi dong dang TEN=gia_tri. Khong de dau nhay, khong de khoang trang quanh dau =.
#   - Dong bat dau bang # la ghi chu.
#   - Chi dung ky tu ASCII (file duoc doc nhu .properties).
#   - Bien moi truong cua he dieu hanh (neu co) duoc uu tien hon gia tri trong .env.
#
# KHONG commit file .env (da co trong .gitignore). Khong gui key/mat khau len chat nhom.
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SQL Server  (bat buoc neu tai khoan SQL Server cua ban khac mac dinh)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mac dinh app dung user "sa" / mat khau "12345678", database OnlineShopDB tren localhost:1433.
# Neu may ban dung mat khau khac, bo dau # o 2 dong duoi va dien vao.
# Database OnlineShopDB phai duoc tao truoc; Flyway se tu tao bang va du lieu mau.
# DB_USERNAME=sa
# DB_PASSWORD=12345678


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Cloudinary  (bat buoc de upload anh: avatar, san pham, bai viet, slider, phan hoi)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lay o: https://console.cloudinary.com/settings/api-keys
#   - Dang ky / dang nhap Cloudinary (goi Free la du).
#   - Cloud name: hien o goc tren ben trai Console (hoac trang Dashboard).
#   - Bam "Generate New API Key" neu chua co, copy API Key va API Secret.
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Chatbox tro ly ao - Google Gemini  (tuy chon, mien phi)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Khong dien thi chatbox van hien nhung se bao "Tro ly ao chua duoc cau hinh".
# Lay key mien phi, khong can the:
#   - Vao https://aistudio.google.com/apikey va dang nhap bang tai khoan Google.
#   - Bam "Create API key", copy chuoi key (thuong bat dau bang AIza... hoac AQ....).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Model mac dinh va model du phong (dung khi model chinh qua tai 503 / het luot 429).
# Thuong khong can doi. Xem danh sach model: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest
# GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest
